# System git config (atsbx hardening layer).
#
# The sandbox permits egress only over HTTPS through the local proxy
# (.github.com on 443; https_proxy is set in /etc/environment). SSH git
# (git@github.com: / ssh://, port 22) and the git:// protocol are dropped by the
# nftables egress rule, so rewrite those forms to HTTPS. This makes clones,
# fetches, and pushes work over the allow-listed path without per-repo tweaks.
# insteadOf applies to fetch and push alike.
[url "https://github.com/"]
	insteadOf = git@github.com:
	insteadOf = ssh://git@github.com/
	insteadOf = git://github.com/
